  message: "Done in PR #2246. Close condition, each part: (1) a real run that meets the target, with its line: \"smart-test: 11 s to the end of the tests (local target 60 s): the tests 5 s, the rest 5 s, the type gate 1 s (243 tests, 7 test-seconds)\" (wall/logs/quick.log of the build directory). (2) a real run that misses it: \"smart-test: 196 s to the end of the tests, 136 s OVER the 60 s local target. Largest first: the tests 187 s, the rest 8 s, the type gate 1 s (4025 tests, 916 test-seconds). Slowest test: 76.8 s tests.test_smart_test_bed::test_each_selection_stage_does_its_one_job\" (wall/logs/selected.log). (3) tests for the report: packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_wall_time.py, and two tests in test_smart_test_recorders.py that the line is printed locally and not in CI. Reported, not enforced: the line never changes the exit code. NOT SEEN in a real line: a run where the selection (analysis or graph walk) is the largest part; in both runs above it was under a second and is inside 'the rest'. The unit test covers that wording."  # fc74
